<title>UK: Powell Duffryn says Q1 in line.</title>
<headline>Powell Duffryn says Q1 in line.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>British ports and shipping services group Powell Duffryn Plc said on Friday that first-quarter trading was in line with expectations.</p>
<p>&quot;The group continues to make progress. After three months of the new financial year, our ports and shipping services results are satisfactorily ahead of the prior year,&quot; the company said.</p>
<p>The company said it was optimistic it would achieve its expected progress this year despite the further rise in the pound.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
